<section class="exhibits" aria-label="In this room">
  <div class="arc-wall">
    <p class="arc-line">A single value is a point. <b>Five years is a sentence.</b></p>
  </div>
  <div class="prose-copy">
    <p class="wall-copy">Labs come back as points; patterns across years live nowhere. SteadyTending keeps the long arc of your own data in view: every result as far back as it goes, several markers at once, and notes on what changed along the way.</p>
    <p class="wall-copy soft">The only person at the intersection of all your data is you. SteadyTending doesn’t pretend to do that work for you. It gives the work a place to happen.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="honest">SteadyTending isn’t a medical device, doesn’t diagnose, and doesn’t replace your clinician. It’s a place to think alongside the care you already have.</p>
</section>
